To make a POST request to the `Restock Consumer` endpoint of `vendor-stockkeeper-api` for a stage environment, you can use the following `curl` command, ensuring to set the `x-api-scope` header to `stage` and provide the `inbound_shipment_id` in the request body:
```bash
curl --location 'https://vendor-stockkeeper-test.techzoneoffice.com/fp/inventory/operations/restock-new' \
--header 'x-api-scope: stage' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "msg": {
        "inbound_shipment_id": "900000734"
    }
}'
```
